  "context": [
    "",
    "Hello",
    "hello",
    "What can I help you wih",
    "Can you help recommend a movie trailer to watch?",
    "I would recommend horror movies, but I would like to know what movies you like first",
    "Oh, I love action movies.",
    "The types with very serious actors (Stallone, etc) or, like Guardians of the Galaxy?",
    "I like both, but I'm looking for something super hero related, like Guardians of the Galaxy.",
    "Oh! I have a few ideas of what you have in mind. Are comic book characters interesting at all?",
    "Yes! I love comic book characters, like Spider man, Ironman and Captain America.",
    "Okay. Would you like to watch this trailer for the Avengers?",
    "Oh that would be great!",
    "I haven't actually watched it yet. It is the one with that Thanos character and the Justice league, right?",
    "No, the Justice League is not in this movie, but Thanos sure is.",
    "I'm a fan! I hope it's a good trailer.",
    "It should be, these superhero mashups have been great so far.",
    "And the new Joker has been all meme'd up, but I haven't heard much about it. Do you like those movies at all?",
    "Yes I watch all of those movies, I actually just watched Joker and it was fantastic. Joaquin Phoenix did an awesome job portraying the Joker.",
    "It's about time for a new TMNT for realsies or a grimey comic character, and plus in the comic universe, how many times has Gambit had a starring role? I think they skipped him.",
    "I heard he was supposed to get a movie, but that was before Disney bought out Fox. I'm not so into TMNT anymore, I stopped watching them when I was a kid.",
    "The nostalgia and filmography in like the Mario movies in the 90s had a certain style that was masked over recently. I can't remember which films.",
    "Movies in the 90's were great. I still remember a movie called The Wizard, but I think it came out in 1989. Anyways thanks for the Avengers trailer recommendation."
